OL,3,GNEWSAPlans progress but 550 flats
OL,4,Ademolition 'not imminent'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGill Williams, cabinet member for
OL,7,Fhousing, acknowledged the "unsettling"
OL,8,Fsituation but reassured residents it
OL,9,Fwould take "some time" to get to
OL,10,Fredevelopment.
